diff --git a/web/README.md b/web/README.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..28a55aa
--- /dev/null
+++ b/web/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@
+# Web package
+
+The web application is a single FastAPI deployment organized into three internal areas:
+
+- `admin/` contains administrator authentication and admin-only routes.
+- `channel/` contains Twitch streamer authentication and the streamer dashboard routes.
+- `shared/` contains infrastructure used by both sides, including templates, OAuth helpers, metrics, and health checks.
+
+Templates follow the same boundary under `templates/admin/` and `templates/channel/`. Static assets remain shared under `static/`.
+
+`app.py` is the composition root. It mounts shared assets and registers routers exported by each package. Moving a router between packages must not change its public URL.
